# local-only files: never committed
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# chat / night notes stay local (the committed runs/*.txt excerpts are cited upstream and stay tracked)
runs/*.md
# ON PURPOSE (author, 2026-11-17): chats' throwaway helper scripts (dispatch / watch / generator scripts) stay local
runs/scratch_keep/
# ON PURPOSE (author, 2026-11-17): report.yml spec inputs are pasted into the form; their content is already
# public as shots/<slug>/ (index.html, TESTS.md, sheet.png), so a copy on main adds nothing
runs/*.json
# ON PURPOSE (author, 2026-11-17): raw `gcloud firebase test android models list` dump (re-list before each question)
runs/firebase_devices.txt
# ON PURPOSE (author, 2026-11-17): raw device-lab logs (Test Lab console downloads) stay local; only scanned excerpts get tracked
runs/DL*crash*.txt
runs/DL*_log*.txt
# scanned excerpts of those logs ARE tracked (the line above would hide them)
!runs/DL*_excerpt.txt
